/T (The Greon color palette is intentionally minimal yet striking, built on a dynamic contrast between the natural world and digital innovation. Our deep Forest Green serves as the grounding foundation, conveying stability, the physical earth, and authoritative expertise. This is paired with a vibrant, energetic Mint Green that represents clean technology, renewable energy, and the forward-thinking AI driving our platform. Together with crisp white accents, this dual-tone system creates a modern, highly legible visual identity that feels both deeply eco-conscious and technologically advanced, perfect for a sleek web app interface.)
