300 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 158 0 R
/T (The typography of Greon is designed for maximum clarity, modernity, and seamless digital readability. Our primary display typeface, Neometric Medium, provides a distinct, geometric foundation that reinforces our tech-forward and innovative identity. For our structural hierarchy and UI text, we utilize the highly versatile Poppins family. This clean sans-serif allows for a highly organized user experience, scaling effortlessly from commanding Poppins Bold for large, impactful headings down to Poppins Light and Thin for highly legible paragraph text. This dynamic range of weights ensures that even our most complex AI data and energy insights are presented in an accessible, structured, and visually pleasing manner.)
/E (The typography of Greon is designed for maximum clarity, modernity, and seamless digital readability. Our primary display typeface, Neometric Medium, provides a distinct, geometric foundation that reinforces our tech-forward and innovative identity. For our structural hierarchy and UI text, we utilize the highly versatile Poppins family. This clean sans-serif allows for a highly organized user experience, scaling effortlessly from commanding Poppins Bold for large, impactful headings down to Poppins Light and Thin for highly legible paragraph text. This dynamic range of weights ensures that even our most complex AI data and energy insights are presented in an accessible, structured, and visually pleasing manner.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
>>
